<Base title="About Car Crash Plus"><article class="wrap article"><h1>About Car Crash Plus</h1><p>Car Crash Plus is an independent information publication focused on road safety, motor vehicle crash data and practical accident resources. Our initial geographic focus is Arizona.</p><h2>Editorial standards</h2><p>We identify original sources, distinguish crash counts from person counts, document methods and limitations, and avoid treating correlation as causation. We distinguish published agency statistics from our own analysis.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>We are not affiliated with a government agency or law firm. Any future sponsored placements will be identified separately from editorial content.</p></article></Base>